message: "If you use this software or the accompanying paper, please cite it as below."
type: article
title: "Certify, Then Repair: Exact Worst-Case Guarantees for Recurrent Policies Trained Against Strong Teachers"
authors:
  - family-names: "Rosario Reyes"
    given-names: "Starlyn Eliezer"
    email: "starlynelizerrosario@gmail.com"
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher, Santo Domingo, Dominican Republic"
year: 2026
version: "2.0.1"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.21077401"
repository-code: "https://github.com/starlyn2010/fragility-paper"
license: "Apache-2.0"
keywords:
  - reinforcement-learning
  - tic-tac-toe
  - tie-breaking
  - minimax
  - certification
  - certificate-guided-repair
